  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Migration RF (fas1+2)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migration Russia (ph1+2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">(569/02) En inledande planerings- och kontaktresa till Moskva skall f&#xf6;retas av Migrationsverket i syfte att detaljplanera n&#xe4;stkommande mer omfattande insats p&#xe5; migrationsomr&#xe5;det i Ryssland.    (189/02) Ett seminarie i St Petersburg ang asylprocess, ett samarrangemang med UNHCR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at strenghtening the adminstrative capacity of the Russian migration service and support the ongoing legislative and organisational reform and its implementation. Initially, a study visit to Russia will be undertaken in order to plan future bilateral cooperation. During the spring 2002, a seminar on the asylum process will be undertaken together with UNHCR (St Petersburg).</narrative>
  </description>
